{"id":"n70222-1-9","stage":1,"title":"유치원 · 幼儿园","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70222-1-9-1","ko":"지수는 꿈이 뭐야?","zh":"智秀，你的梦想是什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수는","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"꿈이","meaning":"梦想","explanation":"꿈：梦想；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"꿈","audio":"/audio/30fb5e8ccd7b82b30b61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57279","senseId":"2","lemma":"꿈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐야?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"30fb5e8ccd7b82b3","term":"꿈","zh":"梦想","audio":"/audio/30fb5e8ccd7b82b30b61.mp3","entryId":"57279","definition":"以后想实现的希望或目标。","pronunciation":["꿈"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/5a761a38c557eafa5136.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70222-1-9-2","ko":"난 아이들을 좋아해서 유치원 교사가 되고 싶어.","zh":"我喜欢孩子，所以想成为一名幼儿园老师。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아이들을","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아해서","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"유치원","meaning":"幼儿园","explanation":"유치원：幼儿园","readings":[{"term":"유치원","audio":"/audio/cbce26e76d88a843f0c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70222","senseId":"1","lemma":"유치원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"교사가","meaning":"教师","explanation":"교사：教师；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"교사","audio":"/audio/df8671acdd670935b501.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24037","senseId":"1","lemma":"교사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되고","meaning":"成为，变为","explanation":"되다：成为，变为；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싶어.","meaning":"希望","explanation":"싶다：希望；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"싶다","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62657","senseId":"4","lemma":"싶다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]},{"id":"cbce26e76d88a843","term":"유치원","zh":"幼儿园","audio":"/audio/cbce26e76d88a843f0c7.mp3","entryId":"70222","definition":"在进入小学之前教育小孩的机关和设施。","pronunciation":["유치원"]},{"id":"df8671acdd670935","term":"교사","zh":"教师","audio":"/audio/df8671acdd670935b501.mp3","entryId":"24037","definition":"在幼儿园、小学、初中和高中等学校具备资格教授学生的人。","pronunciation":["교ː사"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，变为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"拥有新的身份或地位。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"b3ad33de22cbca64","term":"싶다","zh":"希望","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3","entryId":"62657","definition":"表示盼望前面内容能够实现或有做前面行动的想法。","pronunciation":["십따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f72e911b09586f22ef6a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.593,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70222","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":48,"sequenceScore":2.1906,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我喜欢孩子，所以想成为一名幼儿园老师。","我的小外甥，好久不见，长大了不少。","智秀，你的梦想是什么？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我喜欢孩子，所以想成为一名幼儿园老师。","智秀，你的梦想是什么？","我的小外甥，好久不见，长大了不少。"],"answer":0}]}
